<title>MAURITIUS: Mauritius rupee firms on dollar, weaker on pound.</title>
<headline>Mauritius rupee firms on dollar, weaker on pound.</headline>
<dateline>PORT LOUIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Mauritian rupee firmed against the dollar but weakened versus the pound on Monday, commercial banks forex dealers said.</p>
<p>The rupee was fixed at a mean commercial rate of 20.6325 on Friday. Against the pound, the rupee traded at a mean of 32.6175 from 32.090 on Friday.</p>
